{
  "$comment": [
    "Every hook is registered in EXEC form (command + args), never shell form. Claude Code",
    "expands ${CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR} itself, into both fields, before any shell sees it — so",
    "there is no shell and no quoting, and one entry is correct on Gentoo, Debian and",
    "Windows alike. Shell form would need $VAR on bash and $env:/%VAR% on Windows, where",
    "Claude Code falls back to PowerShell if Git Bash is absent. scripts/check-hooks.mjs",
    "fails the build on a shell-form entry, on a registration pointing at a file that does",
    "not exist, and on a hook file that no event registers.",
    "",
    "The codegraph `UserPromptSubmit` hook is deliberately NOT declared here: it already",
    "lives in ~/.claude/settings.json, and project settings merge with user settings, so a",
    "second declaration would inject the same context twice.",
    "",
    "Machine-specific overrides belong in .claude/settings.local.json, which .gitignore",
    "already excludes."
  ],
  "hooks": {
    "SessionStart": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node",
            "args": ["${CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR}/.claude/hooks/session-start.mjs"],
            "statusMessage": "Reading the tree, the contract chain and the notes",
            "timeout": 20
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PreToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "Write|Edit|MultiEdit|NotebookEdit",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node",
            "args": ["${CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR}/.claude/hooks/guard-generated-files.mjs"],
            "timeout": 10
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "Bash",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node",
            "args": ["${CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR}/.claude/hooks/guard-build-commands.mjs"],
            "timeout": 10
          },
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node",
            "args": ["${CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR}/.claude/hooks/guard-long-running.mjs"],
            "timeout": 10
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PostToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "Write|Edit",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node",
            "args": ["${CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR}/.claude/hooks/check-dotnet-build.mjs"],
            "statusMessage": "Building the project you just edited",
            "timeout": 60
          },
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node",
            "args": ["${CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR}/.claude/hooks/check-lint.mjs"],
            "statusMessage": "Linting the file you just edited",
            "timeout": 60
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "ExitPlanMode",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node",
            "args": ["${CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR}/.claude/hooks/plan-eval.mjs", "--before"],
            "statusMessage": "Recalling docs/notes for this plan",
            "timeout": 20
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "Stop": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node",
            "args": ["${CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR}/.claude/hooks/plan-eval.mjs", "--after"],
            "statusMessage": "Evaluating what this plan taught",
            "timeout": 20
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
